orks.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Featuring a powerful C++++ optical transmitter with 9dBm output, it supports long-distance transmission up to 20km or more over single-mode fiber (SMF). Designed for OLT (Optical Line Terminal) applications, this hot-pluggable SFP module uses an SC connector and complies with industry GPON standards.</span></div><h3><br></h3><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">High-Speed Data Rates: 2.5Gbps downstream / 1.25Gbps upstream</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Optical Power Output: 9dBm (C++++ class) for extended reach</span></li><li>Transmission Distance: Up to 20km+ over SMF</li><li>Connector Type: SC/UPC</li><li>Wavelength: 1490nm (TX) / 1310nm (RX)</li><li>GPON OLT Compatible: Ideal for ISPs, telecoms, and FTTH deployments</li><li>Low Power Consumption &amp; Hot-Pluggable SFP Form Factor</li><li>High Stability and Reliability in demanding network environments</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL GPON OLT PON SFP Module 2.5G C++++ 9dBm","href":"/vsol-gpon-pon-sfp-module-25g-c-9dbm","now":"2,300৳","old":"2,800৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM EPON OLT PON SFP Module 1.25G PX20++++","href":"/ecom-epon-olt-pon-sfp-module-125g-px20","now":"2,200৳","old":"2,400৳","single":""},{"name":"D CORE EPON OLT PON SFP Module E14D9PX20 Optical Transceiver","href":"/dcore-epon-olt-pon-sfp-module-e14d9px20-optical-transceiver","now":"1,900৳","old":"2,000৳","single":""},{"name":"D CORE GPON OLT PON SFP Module G14D9C+++ High-Power Class C+++ GPON Transceiver","href":"/dcore-gpon-olt-pon-sfp-module-g14d9c-high-power-class-c-gpon-transceiver","now":"2,000৳","old":"2,100৳","single":""},{"name":"D CORE OT-XS1000G XPON SFP ONU Stick","href":"/dcore-ot-xs1000g-xpon-sfp-onu-stick","now":"","old":"","single":"